1676	         the consumer idle, then drains, until the messages are moved. lagging 2t: the producer \
1677	         streams while the consumer reads two segments' worth between {}us pauses, so the producer \
1678	         runs ahead across segments at every pause. stream 2t: both spinning, the two_t loops' \
1679	         shape.",
1680	        LAG_PAUSE.as_micros()
1681	    ));
1682	    legend(
1683	        "shape: segments x slots per segment. The first rows are the stress shape. The switch \
1684	         cost rows are the same 32 slots as one segment, which never switches, and as 32 segments \
1685	         of one slot, which switches on nearly every message.",
1686	    );
1687	    legend(&format!(
1688	        "ns/msg: elapsed over the messages moved, `-` where the line's pace is the consumer's \
1689	         pauses. segs: segments the producer wrote into, of the ring's. switches: segment \
1690	         switches, the producer's count, which the consumer's matched. sw/msg: switches per \
1691	         message, the burst's 3 per {} at the stress shape.",
1692	        STRESS_SEGMENTS * DEPTH
